:answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406107}] :question/id #uuid "574c4856-8c8e-5211-9580-de409f2cb2a5" :question/problem "Source question: 5.\n\n**Question 5**\n\nEliminate $t$ from $x(t)=8\\sin t$, $y(t)=5\\cos t$, $0\\le t\\le2\\pi$. Enter an exact rectangular equation: {{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "Divide the coordinates by their amplitudes: $x/8=\\sin t$ and $y/5=\\cos t$. Squaring and adding gives $x^2/64+y^2/25=1$."}] [[:assigned-problem/id #uuid "df687ff5-4d56-5697-a482-53619d2295c0"] {:assigned-problem/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405317} :assigned-problem/id #uuid "df687ff5-4d56-5697-a482-53619d2295c0" :assigned-problem/topic-coverage [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049462} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049494} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049678}] :db/id #edb/ref 17592186405737}] [[:answer/id #uuid "4a27a9a2-818f-55c6-8efd-bbca3d105a46"] {:answer/id #uuid "4a27a9a2-818f-55c6-8efd-bbca3d105a46" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "(x+3)^2+(y-1)^2=4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186405985}] [[:answer-field/id #uuid "b4bb8d28-5436-57a8-8526-ba17b15fa7e1"] {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4a27a9a2-818f-55c6-8efd-bbca3d105a46" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "(x+3)^2+(y-1)^2=4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186405985}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405985} :answer-field/id #uuid "b4bb8d28-5436-57a8-8526-ba17b15fa7e1" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406181}] [[:question/id #uuid "2231ecda-8c7c-50fd-a1be-159439d28d06"] {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405143 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4a27a9a2-818f-55c6-8efd-bbca3d105a46" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "(x+3)^2+(y-1)^2=4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186405985}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405985} :answer-field/id #uuid "b4bb8d28-5436-57a8-8526-ba17b15fa7e1" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406181}] :question/id #uuid "2231ecda-8c7c-50fd-a1be-159439d28d06" :question/problem "**Question 6 — Part A**\n\nEnter the rectangular equation: {{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "We have $x+3=2\\sin t$ and $y-1=2\\cos t$, so $(x+3)^2+(y-1)^2=4$. The parameter restriction gives $x\\ge-3$, selecting the right semicircle."}] [[:answer/id #uuid "2c754fcf-b952-5a44-8b1f-f2d161880fd6"] {:answer/feedback "The center is $(-3,1)$ and the radius is $2$. Since $\\sin t\\ge0$ on $[0,\\pi]$, the curve is the right semicircle, from $(-3,3)$ through $(-1,1)$ to $(-3,-1)$." :answer/id #uuid "2c754fcf-b952-5a44-8b1f-f2d161880fd6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "images/d8/d8d313e6992bdcee73117a6545d58863158f954e7cf02323b354d7dc063246db.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186405922}] [[:answer/id #uuid "e8f4dc34-31e7-5e75-ac5a-762fee93054d"] {:answer/feedback "This graph lies near a center in the fourth quadrant. The offsets in the equations instead give center $(-3,1)$ in the second quadrant." :answer/id #uuid "e8f4dc34-31e7-5e75-ac5a-762fee93054d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "images/3d/3d57f723a301e24bca20d2afba11c916dc64a227f01b2b3e0c1303fb970dd09d.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406278}] [[:answer/id #uuid "4291a4de-b807-5127-8bca-dfd647a038f8"] {:answer/feedback "This graph selects a lower semicircle. The restriction $0\\le t\\le\\pi$ makes $x+3=2\\sin t\\ge0$, selecting the right half instead." :answer/id #uuid "4291a4de-b807-5127-8bca-dfd647a038f8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "images/0d/0de918c52f40b809ab0ecc0f82a21a5abbb915759e660deec65b6c8985ec05a9.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186405963}] [[:answer/id #uuid "280f25c7-31e9-56e9-8abd-b7765c2d105f"] {:answer/feedback "This graph is an upper semicircle near a fourth-quadrant center. The required center is $(-3,1)$ and the required half satisfies $x\\ge-3$."