07-6676-50bd-8ebb-e2158645f0f0" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406074}] :question/id #uuid "62ea1902-3f7a-5886-8f6a-f7c0d2a853a7" :question/problem "Source question: 10.\n\n**Question 10**\n\nFind the distance traveled along $x(t)=3\\cos t$, $y(t)=3\\sin t$ during $0\\le t\\le2\\pi$. Give an exact answer.\n\n$s=$ {{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "The particle has speed $\\sqrt{(-3\\sin t)^2+(3\\cos t)^2}=3$. Integrating for $2\\pi$ units of parameter gives $s=6\\pi$. The displacement is zero, but the distance traveled is one circumference."}] [[:assigned-problem/id #uuid "0d80bcf3-3ed4-57fb-b172-6b028992696e"] {:assigned-problem/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405348} :assigned-problem/id #uuid "0d80bcf3-3ed4-57fb-b172-6b028992696e" :assigned-problem/topic-coverage [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050537} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050866}] :db/id #edb/ref 17592186405088}] [[:step/id #uuid "d844ea27-8b17-5fbb-ad56-d4f9d28782f2"] {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405717 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405245} :step/id #uuid "d844ea27-8b17-5fbb-ad56-d4f9d28782f2" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405203}}] [[:step/id #uuid "33729004-b50e-5d2f-834e-d49725efa1e1"] {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405203 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405751} :step/id #uuid "33729004-b50e-5d2f-834e-d49725efa1e1" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405229}}] [[:step/id #uuid "3c4b870b-8c96-5748-a850-278f9c3ea827"] {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405229 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405744} :step/id #uuid "3c4b870b-8c96-5748-a850-278f9c3ea827" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405572}}] [[:step/id #uuid "aa1cb56f-f5cf-54cb-acd9-960b646cf6c1"] {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405572 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405137} :step/id #uuid "aa1cb56f-f5cf-54cb-acd9-960b646cf6c1" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405534}}] [[:step/id #uuid "9b33b557-7783-5bc2-917b-0a8f37b681f7"] {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405534 :step/con