] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186406105} :answer-field/id #uuid "1577ca1a-b127-51a3-8cab-36bcc06dfaff" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186405872}] :question/id #uuid "1ca271d3-4582-50a5-83b5-c55a68699ac7" :question/problem "Source question: 12.\n\nLet $\\mathbf F=\\frac1\\rho\\langle5x,5y,5z\\rangle$, where $\\rho=\\sqrt{x^2+y^2+z^2}$. Calculate $\\nabla\\cdot\\mathbf F$ in terms of ρ.\n\nAnswer: {{answer}}." :question/worked-solution "For ρ>0, ∂(5x/ρ)/∂x=5/ρ−5x²/ρ³, and similarly for y and z. Add to get 15/ρ−5(x²+y²+z²)/ρ³=10/ρ. The field and its divergence are undefined at the origin."}] [[:assigned-problem/id #uuid "b583644b-9078-5138-aa06-57a170cc2de4"] {:assigned-problem/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405121} :assigned-problem/id #uuid "b583644b-9078-5138-aa06-57a170cc2de4" :assigned-problem/topic-coverage [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049465}] :db/id #edb/ref 17592186405609}] [[:step/id #uuid "901b49af-c35f-5c52-8f93-0a3d38d35191"] {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405504 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405175} :step/id #uuid "901b49af-c35f-5c52-8f93-0a3d38d35191" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405306}}] [[:step/id #uuid "51d79b89-5ff3-5106-aaa4-183df5ec38b5"] {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405306 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405391} :step/id #uuid "51d79b89-5ff3-5106-aaa4-183df5ec38b5" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405569}}] [[:step/id #uuid "a841ee07-9a09-556f-8619-b004b9cd249f"] {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405569 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405347} :step/id #uuid "a841ee07-9a09-556f-8619-b004b9cd249f" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405059}}] [[:step/id #uuid "034c1800-2acf-59d3-92e4-1a2cb6e56af2"] {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405059 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405518} :step/id #uuid "034c1800-2acf-59d3-92e4-1a2cb6e56af2" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405436}}] [[:step/id #uuid "7b4e4fac-50e2-5400-8062-b6085aa57a72"] {:db/id #edb/ref 17592