ct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186406306} :answer-field/id #uuid "d529baec-f388-57a2-a8b5-4847a703376a" :answer-field/key "eq-f" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406241} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c5ee8931-8416-54e9-a2e7-18279a58b42e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045500} :answer/value "c" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406213}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186406213} :answer-field/id #uuid "d9b56777-c4c1-5c64-b1a7-0ef581712f59" :answer-field/key "eq-e" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406252} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "12db037d-f618-5aba-9dcf-06c12790db54" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045500} :answer/value "i" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186405868}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405868} :answer-field/id #uuid "ec795b07-780f-5f96-899a-d093efe7bc8b" :answer-field/key "curve-d" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406285}] :question/id #uuid "e0f837df-c792-5a57-9571-6a1dd942cb26" :question/problem "Source question: 1, PDF page 2.\n\nMatch plots A–F to equations (a)–(f) and flow curves (i)–(vi).\n\n![Vector field plots A–F](images/59/59baa4c104233f8ce590e72bb194a56ec065ff68a1220ab92f2e138f39ee43b2.png)\n\n| Equation | Vector field | Curve | Parameterization |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| (a) | $\\langle0,x\\rangle$ | (i) | $\\langle1,t\\rangle$ |\n| (b) | $\\langle y,x\\rangle$ | (ii) | $\\langle\\cos t,\\sin t\\rangle$ |\n| (c) | $\\langle x,y-x\\rangle$ | (iii) | $\\langle\\tan t,\\sec t\\rangle$ |\n| (d) | $\\langle1,2\\rangle$ | (iv) | $\\langle2t,t\\rangle$ |\n| (e) | $\\langle x,y\\rangle$ | (v) | $\\langle t,2t\\rangle$ |\n| (f) | $\\langle-y,x\\rangle$ | (vi) | $\\langle e^t,e^t-te^t\\rangle$ |\n\nEnter the original equation letters and curve Roman numerals.\n\nPlot A: equation {{eq-a}}; curve {{curve-a}}.\n\nPlot B: equation {{eq-b}}; curve {{curve-b}}.\n\nPlot C: equation {{eq-c}}; curve {{curve-c}}.\n\nPlot D: equation {{eq-d}}; curve {{curve-d}}.\n\nPlot E: equation {{eq-e}}; curve {{curve-e}}.\n\nPlot F: equation {{eq-f}}; curve {{curve-f}}." :question/worked-solution "A is radial, B is constant northeast, C rotates counterclockwise, D is vertical with sign set by x, E has components (x,y-x), and F has components (y,x). Thus A–e–iv, B–d–v, C–f–ii, D–a–i, E–c–vi, F–b–iii.\n\nFor (i), (ii), (v), and (vi), direct differentiation gives $\\mathbf r'=\\mathbf F(\\mathbf r)$. For (iii), $\\mathbf r'=\\sec t\\,\\mathbf F(\\mathbf r)$ on its domain. For (iv), $\\mathbf F(\\mathbf r)=t\\mathbf r'$. Thus the last two are geometrically tangent parameterizations, not solutions of $\\mathbf r'=\\mathbf F(\\mathbf r)$ as written. Curve (iv) passes through the equilibrium at t=0 and follows the field orientation only on t>0; treat its two rays separately. On intervals where sec t<0, curve (iii) has reversed orientation. The supplied matching uses geometric flow paths."}] [[:assigned-problem/id #uuid "4ed75a27-f552-5b95-a2a6-0be6b8193c2c"] {:assigned-problem/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186405749} :assigned-problem/id #uuid "4ed75a27-f552-5b95-a2a6-0be6b8193c2c" :assigned-problem/topic-coverage [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048239} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048923} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049721}] :db/id #edb/ref 17592186405294}] [[:answer/id #uuid "cb8bd873-c1a5-51f2-9f1b-ed3dad940eb6"] {:answer/id #uuid "cb8bd873-c1a5-51f2-9f1b-ed3dad940eb6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045500} :answer/value "e" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406223}] [[:answer-field/id #uuid "e4c0ca37-0193-55c9-ba66-282ac52afb17"] {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cb8bd873-c1a5-51f2-9f1b-ed3dad940eb6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045500} :answer/value "e" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406223}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186406223} :answer-field/id #uuid "e4c0ca37-0193-55c9-ba66-282ac52afb17" :answer-field/key "plot-a" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 1759218