t supporting work do not earn full credit. Work on the printed worksheet, digitally on the PDF, or on separate paper with the same layout. Include first name, last name, and OSU student ID on the cover. Upload a single six-page PDF to Gradescope under **Written Homework 2**: cover followed by one page per problem, including blank problems. Scan printed work or photograph separate pages; combine multiple pages for a problem into one page before merging. Digital work already follows the template. Incorrect formatting receives 0. No due date is stated in the PDF." :tutorial/id #uuid "228f7037-f111-552e-a947-9f78f9f850de" :tutorial/title "Assignment information"}] [[:answer/id #uuid "f361981f-7919-5801-8d44-ed81c1683938"] {:answer/id #uuid "f361981f-7919-5801-8d44-ed81c1683938" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "\\langle e^x\\sin y,e^x\\cos y\\rangle" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406298}] [[:answer-field/id #uuid "b0ccca34-1006-56c5-9423-d626b08e8069"] {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f361981f-7919-5801-8d44-ed81c1683938" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "\\langle e^x\\sin y,e^x\\cos y\\rangle" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406298}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186406298} :answer-field/id #uuid "b0ccca34-1006-56c5-9423-d626b08e8069" :answer-field/key "gradient" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406174}] [[:answer/id #uuid "a51f2fd5-4aaf-5b6f-a23e-7dc344cf875a"] {:answer/id #uuid "a51f2fd5-4aaf-5b6f-a23e-7dc344cf875a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045500} :answer/value "None." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406156}] [[:answer-field/id #uuid "0fb117f7-d930-5974-b2b3-6bb82c576c68"] {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a51f2fd5-4aaf-5b6f-a23e-7dc344cf875a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045500} :answer/value "None." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406156}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186406156} :answer-field/id #uuid "0fb117f7-d930-5974-b2b3-6bb